			description: ["Bram: \"Race is cut, boards are dry, and I'm sixty-four. Two wheels, today.\"", "", "Craft &a2 Water Wheels&r: Bram's way is the Seasoned Oak Boards, Create's own recipe (planks round a shaft) works too. Set them in the mill race beside the mill — that is the whole quest.", "", "Running a shaft from them to the Millstone so it turns without you is worth doing next; the &6Create&r chapter walks it.", "", "Sixty years he waited for that noise. The rest of the mill is in the &6Create&r chapter."]
