			description: ["Marnie: \"Counter, sink, oven, along the back wall in that order. I've had the spots chalked for four years.\"", "", "Hold the Counter, Sink and Oven at hand-in; the book gives them back. Set them on the inn's three grey slabs, 1, 2, 3, then cook &aBread&r, &aPumpkin Pie&r and &aVegetable Soup&r. Marnie sent the pumpkins and the cane — cane makes the sugar.", "", "Oda's broom comes off the back door with the cookbook. Kettles, skillets and teas: &6Cooking and Brewing&r.", "", "Marnie's kitchen is where Act I ends: the next quest, Oda's store, wants eight loaves off this oven."]
